      "created_at": "2015-03-18T18:10:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hey all! I'm new here.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So I've been looking around and I haven't seen it yet but, I was wondering if anyone has translated SotM into Spanish. I'm a native English speaker, but I speak Spanish fluently and I'd love to play this game with some friends who only speak Spanish. If noone has started on a project like this I'd be more than happy to donate my time toward doing this, but if someone else already beat me to it I see no reason to beat the dead horse. to death. with a death stick.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Anyway, I'd love a response!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
