      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/71c47a/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-20T15:22:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That'd be way cool! In the mean time, I'll use the card creator I saw to translate the cards and upload them somewhere for people to see. I think it'd be great to open it up a bit more internationally. I know Mexico is a big consumer of US entertainment so lots of what's popular here is popular there too.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'll make a post about it in the SotM forum when I get things going. It may be a bit but it shouldn't take me too long.</p>",
